note bay 5 review of b203fc8c (same class as x-sleepneg): execprog on a packet whose first record (the program) is empty traps 3
note before any kernel call (OMEGESE s10); ngrun refuses execprog (115) only after that check.
fn main to int
a = new uchar 4 0
put a 0 1
k = execprog a 0 4
ret int and k 255
end
